199: | va-g2-ideas (unit 10, days 145 to 160) | va-g3-ideas (unit 2) | Many solutions and a question of the child's own | Detail and depth added to a made-up idea; the child chooses the tools and resources |
200: | va-g2-revise (unit 10, days 145 to 160) | va-g3-revise (unit 2) | A two-way talk about choices with a classmate | Detail added to strengthen meaning after a partner talk |
201: | va-g2-design (unit 11, days 163 to 178) | va-g3-design (unit 3) | A cast-off object given a new use; an event picture | A model, diagram or map of a familiar place, and art from what the child observes |
