212: |---|---|---|---|---|
213: | Looking | va-g3-look (unit 1, days 1 to 18) | va-g4-look (unit 5): reactions before and after making a similar piece; the parts that carry the message | va-g5-look (unit 9) retrieves va-g4-look (unit 5, days 65 to 80): own reading against others'; cultural links | Clues to process and message, then parts named as carriers, then readings compared and culture as a clue |
214: | Studio and tools | va-g3-craft (unit 1, days 1 to 18) | va-g4-craft (unit 5): tested and invented techniques; the tool check before pointed tools | va-g5-craft (unit 9) retrieves va-g4-craft (unit 5, days 65 to 80): skill built over a practice log; craft as care | Several processes in one work, then invention and a duty of care, then logged practice and fine craft |
215: | Ideas | va-g3-ideas (unit 2, days 19 to 34) | va-g4-ideas (unit 6): several approaches to a design problem; a group goal | va-g5-ideas (unit 10) retrieves va-g4-ideas (unit 6, days 81 to 96): two ideas merged; research methods named and one chosen | One idea grown alone, then routes and a shared goal, then merging and a chosen method |
216: | Revising | va-g3-revise (unit 2, days 19 to 34) | va-g4-revise (unit 6): a revision from a small-group critique with set steps | va-g5-revise (unit 10) retrieves va-g4-revise (unit 6, days 81 to 96): a written artist statement, revised after critique | Partner talk and added detail, then a protocol, then a written statement |
217: | Making for a place | va-g3-design (unit 3, days 37 to 50) | va-g4-design (unit 7): built places of the region recorded from looking | va-g5-design (unit 11) retrieves va-g4-design (unit 7, days 99 to 112): places and objects that matter, labeled in art and design words | Maps and models from memory and the walk, then observed buildings, then chosen places seen freshly |
218: | Meaning and judging | va-g3-judge (unit 3, days 37 to 50) | va-g4-judge (unit 7): background facts feed meaning; one checklist on two works | va-g5-judge (unit 11) retrieves va-g4-judge (unit 7, days 99 to 112): standards that shift with style, time and culture | A given checklist, then one checklist on two works, then the standards themselves compared |
219: | Showing | va-g3-show (unit 4, days 53 to 64) | va-g4-show (unit 8): technology old and new; showing and protecting in different places and formats | va-g5-show (unit 12) retrieves va-g4-show (unit 8, days 115 to 128): the curator's role; an argued choice of safe materials | A chosen space and a note, then a plan for two places, then a named role and an argument |
220: | Museums and settings | va-g3-museum (unit 4, days 53 to 64) | va-g4-museum (unit 8): venues compared, setting inferred from clues, a community tradition made | va-g5-museum (unit 12) retrieves va-g4-museum (unit 8, days 115 to 128): evidence from a real exhibit; art that changes beliefs | Story and record, then inference and tradition, then evidence and change |
